# Claude Code (private dev context)
# CLAUDE.md is TRACKED as of 2026-08-18, deliberately. It was ignored
# while it held private dev context; it now carries the working protocol
# shared verbatim with the ContextQuilt and ShoulderSurf repos, and that
# text is worth nothing unless it travels and can be diffed. Leaving the
# ignore in place while the file is tracked would have left a rule that
# says one thing and a repo that does another.
RENAMING_STRATEGY.md

# pytest
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Locally-mirrored secrets (private keys, etc) — must never reach the repo
private-local-secrets/
*signing_private*

# Local scratch, never committed: eval exports contain real meeting content
tmp/
